      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIZZARO BOY (3) flew the lids with a fast early split and led until late but gathered in when a 1.5 lengths third at this track over 352m in 19.70. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Likely to feature again. AMAZING MILEY (1) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Finished in the minors last time when third (19.93) at this track making it back to back placings. Form here sound including four wins. Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Racing well and deserves a win. TERRA BELLA (2) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 8th at this track following on from a win (29.69) at Q Parklands the start prior. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and is one of the better chances. LITTLE STARSKY (7) is a surprise last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
